{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8cf75bfbdbc08334fcf6cd04f1d8ade342de8e64426bdb0568646ac682e64ff1", "ja": "青空の下でも輝いて♪", "zh": "在蓝天下依然闪耀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3b973408a86598af022e3ada560960dcc8b4b8e88049376f74074a7977bcfbc4", "ja": "公演の打ち上げは飯ごうパーティ！\n流星群観測用に準備した材料で作ったカレー\nやプリンは茜が美味しくたいらげる。\nプロデューサーは、今回の公演で成長したア\nイドル達の今後の輝きに期待するのだった。", "zh": "公演的庆功宴是饭盒派对！\n用之前为了观看流星雨准备的食材制作了\n咖哩及布丁，然后茜津津有味地吃光光了。\n经过这次公演经验，偶像们也有所成长，\n制作人很期待她们今后将会绽放的光彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "465103bea94cc6f672a96c50bbbfdc3aadd5a5a029c93c56f9ea64e8af7c403a", "ja": "（『Starlight Melody』の打ち上げは\n星梨花のリクエストで飯ごうパーティーになった）", "zh": "（在星梨花的要求下，\n『Starlight Melody』的庆功宴决定办成饭盒派对。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "57f78cda4a22cc8f14a92ac3288ce43393bb6d7b2bdac5187b1b1670e300fb73", "ja": "ぐつぐつ……ぐつぐつ……。\nぐつぐつ収まったかな。", "zh": "咕嘟咕嘟……咕嘟咕嘟……\n已经不咕嘟咕嘟了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "e08cf1cf4922e5c4417fc34095380bec04ec6bb105dd35a3414911bd488a169f", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\nごはん炊けましたよー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生──！\n饭煮好了喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "c2c67f0c518881d18980796918119373a8f482dd6359e303661fda993beeb506", "ja": "炊けたら、飯ごうをひっくり返して蒸らしておくの。\n熱くて危ないから、私がやるね。", "zh": "煮好之后要把饭盒翻过来闷。\n太烫了很危险，我来弄吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "315bb6a362ea107d8ce7ff2a5cf201dff423733ee9ef151fe7617501b24f0164", "ja": "なんでひっくり返すんだろう。\n不思議……。", "zh": "为什么要翻过来呢？\n真神奇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "610212c44351728c02236c58bf3e02b171e925184081d9731c31ffd5b39e8691", "ja": "言われてみると、不思議です。\nどうしてなんでしょう？", "zh": "听你这么说，的确很神奇。\n究竟是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "a80dc8943043a2ac2310454bea83d325b348a566232ba5a6a6c7a4cdecbac0f5", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、なんで？", "zh": "琴叶，为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "98fc82720ffeb2140b75286ff43e4e8969ab9eb57fc620c5451931b47311437d", "ja": "えっ、私！？\nうーん、なんでだろう……。", "zh": "咦，问我！？\n嗯──这是为什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "23ae06ac1cd03f3ac2e23e904d240012b66278f6ede6640b533802241497a9ec", "ja": "カレーの準備もできました。\nごはんを蒸らし終わったら、食べられますね。", "zh": "咖哩也煮好了。\n等饭闷好之后就可以吃了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "9e7d15f485a0beed411b3c635ecf0cb65456b37cd6b68d9ccb3e810929fccf02", "ja": "茜ちゃんのために、飯ごうプリンも用意して\nきたんですよ！　見てください、この迫力……！", "zh": "亚利沙为了小茜，还特地准备了饭盒布丁喔！\n请看看这个震撼力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "48d4c6e3889e3acf2ffe2ac2eaf35114b3470a0cb87d8034724350e4c0b2d23b", "ja": "ひゃっほーう！　飯ごう型のプリンはさすがの\n茜ちゃんでも初めてだよ！　いただきまーす！", "zh": "呀哦！就连小茜也是第一次看到饭盒型布丁耶！\n小茜开动了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "068077bf7b4a763f17fcde2f4a7df82b76f6b2369b25e48b2b0705517435e7dd", "ja": "茜も、公演お疲れさま！\nよく頑張ったな、えらいぞ！", "zh": "茜也是，公演辛苦了！\n你很努力呢，很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "bf06662bda10ee60b2b09416dd6867a5931b2396bc3f8e1e164b653c7ee9270e", "ja": "ニャハハ☆　{$P$}ちゃん、\n遠慮しないで！　もっと、もっとほめていいんだよ！", "zh": "喵哈哈☆小{$P$}，\n别客气！再多说几句，多夸小茜一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "02ea14e024167ec694eaa6b8c0331843bb81bad8e0ec3ac1a09ebe0f6daaea4d", "ja": "みんなも、カレーのあとのデザートにどうぞ！\nたくさん食べちゃってくださいね！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "这也是吃完咖哩后的甜点，大家也请用！\n请多吃一点喔！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "af1145cc6f9fac38197d47e058f3c4614a6dcfec26530b85af8fd743ea92550e", "ja": "（みんなでわいわい、太陽の下で食べる食事は本当に\n美味しいな。星空もいいけど、青空もいいものだ）", "zh": "（大家一起热闹地在太阳底下用餐，真的特别美味呢。\n星空固然好，不过蓝天也不错。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "a7a7e71803c970598ed55aa080451ac95424ff34c98b859d8bbf2ee94e81615a", "ja": "ふー、食べた食べた。飯ごうプリンで、\n茜ちゃんの心もお腹も満たされちゃったね！", "zh": "呼──吃饱了吃饱了。\n饭盒布丁让小茜的心灵跟肚子都满足了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "6bce92b1f6fb8a7e9ad0810e42af310c40968e59207c61166352172578be1ed1", "ja": "おいしくて楽しくて、\nありさ、ちょっと食べ過ぎちゃったカモ……？", "zh": "好吃又好玩，\n亚利沙好像有点吃太饱了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "423e14d28e80076a9ed00a1dd09b2541a89a4f93cc5f778d78b28d7a03fb488c", "ja": "ふふっ、本当だね！　カレー、あんなに\nたくさん作ったのに、もう空だもんね。", "zh": "呵呵，就是说啊！\n做了那么多咖哩，结果已经整锅都吃完了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "3e0faae57446d42e53a2d2135615fd0bb4ae6d486af780502df3faa5a250eb7e", "ja": "……未来さん、未来さん。", "zh": "……未来姊姊、未来姊姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "ca81c75455875d73685185a42af7ab403160748722c8496720a41c6c5c353744", "ja": "……くー……。", "zh": "……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f09dda0e08fd4cb56a3f11ea644a0f67ad09e2985edcd841429f18c28805a07", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうしましょう。\n未来さん、寝ちゃいました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么办呢？\n未来姊姊睡着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fb404d43a83c42252b6545ba1fc74e5e52485e63681659fe59c798449ea8af94", "ja": "たくさん食べたし、いい天気だからな。\n眠くなっても仕方ないか……。", "zh": "毕竟吃了很多，天气又这么好，\n她会想睡也是难免的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c54a3da889aff7cb6715465e37ef1a8e02fee730e8bb151a28eb6cb4009bec88", "ja": "ふふっ、帰りの車の中でも、未来ちゃんと星梨花ちゃん\n熟睡しちゃってたものね。", "zh": "呵呵，之前在回程的车上，\n未来跟星梨花都睡得很熟呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "f227de8663270a57eba122872c025cf41a4aa5b5f19970a1757ba1a6f51f7360", "ja": "ありさ、その様子も\nばっちりカメラに収めましたよ！", "zh": "亚利沙已经把当时的情景\n用相机完整记录下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "80571f4ae73be85abcaf4734d6f5bf2532de1fb6a15caebe8c950fe63f1d0f4b", "ja": "えへへ……。\nちょっと、恥ずかしいです。", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n有点害羞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "74d80cf20ce2e0c7ffa9dbc2f6e109bed262fe2ce52283fabf947ff4889e079a", "ja": "そういえば星梨花ちゃん、あのあと大丈夫だった？\n家に帰ってから……。", "zh": "话说回来，星梨花，你在那之后不要紧吧？\n回家以后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "2c742bb0e733010641226158a57f4235fe7808d2b082480b5e4b1624151c11c8", "ja": "あのあと……わたし、パパに怒っちゃいました。", "zh": "在那之后……我对爸爸生气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "74acaeed50ee91b3558ecabac83df450e7b0757ac1efd1046c799f2f22923895", "ja": "えっ？\nお父さんじゃなくて、星梨花が怒ったのか？", "zh": "咦？\n生气的不是爸爸，而是星梨花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "960b5ea8f396c848a15310fb8b734f105198d51cb848715b728277045eadb81b", "ja": "はい。だってあの時は、\nみなさんがわたしを助けてくれたのに……。", "zh": "是的。\n因为那个时候，明明是大家帮了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "7df4e93fdabe4fb132f2154f56b61bcaa98c57ddbdc95dfa33bc44cbb8ea81df", "ja": "パパが{$P$}さんに文句を\n言うなんて言うから、わたし、怒っちゃったんです。", "zh": "爸爸却说要去找{$P$}先生理论，\n所以我就生气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "d62a8a50f79f266e15271a4793a055e3c93d002c56040d9d4be13208213b6607", "ja": "ケガをしたのは、わたしが気をつけなかったからです。\n{$P$}さんは注意してくれてました。", "zh": "我会受伤，都是我自己不小心。\n{$P$}先生明明提醒过我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "6bade06009c745aea0ae4ef108c07cef449c5eadd79f4994d4cc9d8e2b58e942", "ja": "ケガをしたあとも、たくさん心配してくれて。\nなのにお礼じゃなくて、文句を言うだなんて……。", "zh": "而且在我受伤后，也为我担了不少心。\n但爸爸却没有道谢的意思，反而要去理论……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "21f094a53b400f2041019a06355447ff3939b9c012df52bc6e00bb818ae805b1", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "92ebbcbd13273a74aa1ca90ec758b5f69ea5d32daf97282936424e9e49b8351d", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、大人になったねえ。\n茜ちゃん、感心したよ……！", "zh": "星梨花长大了呢。\n小茜好感动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9cedade51bb190ae59614045ca7a45fa0e49ddb9131f89c03d3f72b3cf515e61", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、星梨花。星梨花のお父さんに、\n文句なんて言われてないから。", "zh": "不要紧的，星梨花。\n你的爸爸并没有找我理论。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "85bb7fedfa613e869d537870110101e35ae051d86492eed9079207c25a67fa15", "ja": "本当ですか？", "zh": "真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "87995f90e82b9c949ca244d613760f2b07e79222ff32c77c8cdf989057398d12", "ja": "ああ、おかげ様でな。でもお父さんは、それだけ星梨花\nが心配だったんだ。だから、許してあげてくれよ。", "zh": "嗯，托你的福。不过爸爸会有这种反应，也是代表了\n他有多么担心星梨花。所以，你就原谅他吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1037_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ef1b40b5d1a0990ba3e597cdceddf16e0cc638da93d0f8316785982602c6577", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nはい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n好的，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "b754032c206843c5de5972f98cfa9d680577aa29d0eefe7317b36601d55d4dac", "ja": "…………、……ん？", "zh": "………………嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "96f3a68102a953d9c5d18a9ab11339bf78fb3e138acc0dc0221360ae1e6270c3", "ja": "あ、未来さん！\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊，未来姊姊！\n你醒了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "5cb011b0764bfbdde154930bd2a7609c7a4713bf39c96702e484c41fadf8d020", "ja": "星梨花、おはよー……。\nあれ？　今、流れ星の夢、見てたのに……。", "zh": "星梨花，我醒了……\n咦？我刚刚明明梦到流星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "b33242a51d4f4578e87ef80c3419dbbb8e7d078dc335e5e40026bdb65b91b1f2", "ja": "起きてみたら、昼間だし……。\n流れ星、消えちゃいました。うぅ……。", "zh": "结果一起来就是白天……\n流星消失了啊，呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "bbb7bcacb7d70f2866df3887d27d93b4d59ba2a1a79f7bfb6270dd8b41402c7d", "ja": "そんなことないって、未来。\n流れ星は、消えてない。", "zh": "不是这样的，未来。\n流星并没有消失。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "feb168448519653ae40732b546bb5acba0209729631955d7583da854450a0315", "ja": "消えてない？", "zh": "没有消失？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "4a96afd91d12ea4b174767079bb9249b75393e15ecaaa58812fc890f8e9e2f2e", "ja": "ああ。昼間は見えないだけで、流れ星は今も、\nこの空から降り続けてるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，只是白天看不见流星而已，\n它们现在也正从这片天空落下来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "b5769ed8faa4df25aa7295723f7272faa095531cc81044abd6e413d4479a82f5", "ja": "えーっ！？\nそうなんだ！", "zh": "咦──！？\n原来是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "0791c12d7932ed23789abf2f7a8092ed0180c508f3b073ba64b9ca669b878713", "ja": "本当ですか？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "c223bc0c3d71b9ec447f1a87b1e95cf597dad0d365c2b159b4c420961da0f82b", "ja": "もちろん、本当だよ。流れ星は\nみんなの上に、ずっと降り注いでる……。", "zh": "当然是真的啊。\n流星会一直从大家头上划过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "97dded73bf66e13efa1168752cc6761539b0cbaf3893c1bddf3b140fc7817925", "ja": "今回の公演が終わって一段落しても、\n経験や練習から得た成長は消えないようにな。", "zh": "就好比即便这次的公演已经告一段落，\n你们从经验及练习过程中获得的成长也不会消失。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "0317430a96e331b00f111ec0b1fb7ae139e7f83eafb0cc1eb4e4292c37372ea2", "ja": "成長は消えない……。", "zh": "成长不会消失……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1050_014mir", "source_sha256": "190cd1bb6baa3d165ab69bf1fdc2335a1d5728298e730c6afae6254c0e2b0776", "ja": "ということは……次の公演では、もっともーっと\nパワーアップした私たちを、見せられちゃいますね♪", "zh": "也就是说……在下次公演时，\n我们能够展现出成长更多、更～多的自己呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "ab70c0d9347da2bd2e99efe2372ac3a9cb1b54b1c6aebbcfa878d09b5652fff8", "ja": "ああ。期待してるぞ、みんな！", "zh": "是啊。各位，我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "7d5a18a8b33f7565230fa03b1d5b33e5f3ad69f99532a1ee650a2ceaeea9fcee", "ja": "はーい！　任せてくださいっ♪\nがんばろうね、星梨花。みんなも、一緒に！", "zh": "是──！请交给我♪\n加油吧，星梨花。还有大家，我们一起加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1053_022ser", "source_sha256": "0165dbc26a6b8d38eb444b680869581a38fe790fafd0419d61a8d8f3c85d93c5", "ja": "はい！　これからも\nよろしくお願いします、未来さん！", "zh": "好的！\n今后也请多多指教，未来姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1054_p", "source_sha256": "e6fe20162eac0a0e038e88a00600863fb5a76981ec632d0f68b7e6328a7fcacc", "ja": "（これから、いくつもの小さな冒険が彼女達の\n前に立ちはだかり、みんなを磨いていくだろう）", "zh": "（今后将会有数不清的小小冒险挡在她们面前，\n日渐磨练她们吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1055_p", "source_sha256": "185353903551840cd0d54c24ba937d3d68dfdc27b4b6387ba4a19508ea9b410b", "ja": "（その度に輝きを増し、ステージで流星のように\n輝く彼女達の姿が、はっきりと見える……）", "zh": "（我能够清楚看见，她们每次冒险就变得更加闪耀，\n在舞台上有如流星般耀眼的姿态……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_07_1056_p", "source_sha256": "0c9ea08b615f4c30aa7d8ae36aaec42d7d9a9a12510665d42e69aa5d79183c43", "ja": "（俺にとっては、目の前のアイドル達こそが……\nこの空に輝く、ミリオン流星群だ！）", "zh": "（对我来说，我眼前的这些偶像才是……\n在这片天空中闪耀的百万流星雨！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
